  "historyNote": "#4799, Interim, eff 8-22-90, exp. 6-1-90; ss by #4954, eff 10-16-90; ss by #6336, eff 9-24-96 (from Rev 1605); ss by #8178, eff 9-24-04; ss by #10213, eff 10-24-12; renumbered by #13002 (formerly Rev 1607.02); ss by #13126-B, eff 10-24-20; ss by #13553, eff 2-7-23 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Rev 1600)",
